title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/money.png
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @increase_dues: Increase Party Dues
- @decrease_dues: Decrease Party Dues
- @increase_patronage: Hand Out More Federal Jobs
- @decrease_patronage: Reduce Federal Patronage
- @increase_assessments: Increase Salary Assessments
- @decrease_assessments: Decrease Salary Assessments
- @business_donations: Encourage Business Donations
- @business_donations_no: Discourage Business Donations
- @collect: Collect our cash

@decrease_dues
subtitle: [+ dues - 1 +] resources gained.
choose-if: dues > 0.5
on-arrival: dues -= 0.5;

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase_dues
subtitle: [+ dues + 0.5 +] resources gained. [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 0.5; workers_rep -= 3; unemployed_rep -= 3; workers_rep -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; unemployed_rep -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; workers_rep -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; unemployed_rep -= 3*dues if dues >= 5
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployed >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

@increase_patronage
subtitle: [? if patronage < -7: <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> ?][? if patronage = -7 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> -> <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> ?][? if patronage < -3 and patronage > -7: <span style="color: #81C784;">low</span> ?][? if patronage = -3 : <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> -> <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> ?][? if patronage < 2 and patronage > -3: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">medium</span> ?][? if patronage = 2 : <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> -> <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> ?][? if patronage < 6 and patronage > 2: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">medium</span> ?][? if patronage = 6 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> -> <span style="color: #d42f2f;">Extremely high</span> ?][? if patronage > 6: <span style="color: #d42f2f;">Extremely high</span> ?]
on-arrival: patronage += 1; corruption += 3
choose-if: patronage < 10
unavailable-subtitle: DUDE! STOP HANDING OUT Jobs

We increase patronage within the government in the state and federal government.

@decrease_patronage
subtitle: [? if patronage < -7: <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> ?][? if patronage = -7 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> <- <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> ?][? if patronage < -3 and patronage > -7: <span style="color: #81C784;">low</span> ?][? if patronage = -3 : <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> <- <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> ?][? if patronage < 2 and patronage > -3: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">medium</span> ?][? if patronage = 2 : <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> <- <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> ?][? if patronage < 6 and patronage > 2: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">medium</span> ?][? if patronage = 6 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> <- <span style="color: #d42f2f;">Extremely high</span> ?][? if patronage > 6: <span style="color: #d42f2f;">Extremely high</span> ?]
on-arrival: patronage -= 1; corruption -= 2
choose-if: patronage > -10
unavailable-subtitle: Our system is a total meritocracy

We decrease the amount of patronage within the government in the state and federal government.

@increase_assessments
subtitle: [+ salary_cut_disp + 1 +]%
choose-if: salary_cut < 0.75
unavailable-subtitle: We can't expect to demand more from there salary
on-arrival: salary_cut += 0.1; salary_cut_disp += 1; corruption += 2

We increase the precentage that our government employees have to pay to the party.

@decrease_assessments
subtitle: [+ salary_cut_disp - 1 +]%
choose-if: salary_cut > 0
unavailable-subtitle: We are currently assessment free
on-arrival: salary_cut -= 0.1; salary_cut_disp -= 1; corruption -= 2

We increase the precentage that our government employees have to pay to the party.

@business_donations
subtitle: [+ big_monies + 1 : big_monies +]
choose-if: big_monies < 10
unavailable-subtitle: They are already giving us there all
on-arrival: big_monies += 1; corruption += 3

We encourage wealthy individuals and businesses to donate to our cause.

@business_donations_no
subtitle: [+ big_monies - 1 : big_monies +]
choose-if: big_monies > -10
unavailable-subtitle: Business fundraising in the party is minimal
on-arrival: big_monies += 1; corruption -= 1

We discourage wealthy individuals and businesses to donate to our cause.

@collect
on-arrival: resources += Math.min(10, Math.round(dues + ((patronage + 10) / 20) * 2 + salary_cut * 3 + ((big_monies + 10) / 20) * 3))

We cashed out big time!
